# Data and planning apps

Five small apps handle records, forms, dates, tasks and files. They all have a #O#Share# tab with **Share & Chat**, and they all use the same three [layouts](#/layouts)!


::divider{wavy|Data and planning apps|cyan}
## Mainkey: records

!!#PR#Database# [Open Mainkey](/mainkey)

Build your own fields, then keep records in them. Search, filter and sort in a #O#Table#, or browse a #O#Gallery# with live statistics!

* @clay-4@Home@ has New Record, Add Field, the Table and Gallery views, and Sort By!
* @clay-4@Data@ imports and exports `.kb` files and exports `.csv`, and has Demo Data and Clear All!
* @clay-4@Share@ has a #O#Website Kit# and #O#Host#, which can serve the database straight from your browser tab so others can open it!

## Formly: forms

!!#G#Forms# [Open Formly](/formly)

Build a form with #O#New Form# and #O#Add Field#, flip between #O#Builder# and #O#Preview#, and share it as a file:

* `.kfe` is an #O#editable# form, so the other person can change it!
* `.kfv` is a #O#viewable# form that people fill in!
* `.kfa` holds the #O#answers#!

Question text accepts Keydown, so chips and highlights work in forms. Share & Chat lets a group edit a form together!

## Hexa: calendar and boards

!!#B#Calendar# [Open Hexa](/hexa)

* ++L5(Calendar++ shows months and an agenda for events. #O#Today# and #O#Year# jump around!
* ++L5(Boards++ are columns of cards: #O#New Board#, #O#New Column# and #O#New Card#!
* ++L5(Import and export++ standard `.ics` files (so you can swap with other calendars) and Hexa's own `.kh` files!

## Taskra: to-do lists

!!#O#Todo# [Open Taskra](/taskra)

Tasks have priorities and due dates. Filter with #O#All Tasks#, #O#Active#, #O#Done# and #O#Overdue#, and use #O#Clear Completed# to tidy up. Lists import and export as `.tk` files!

## Cabinet: drive

!!#R#Drive# [Open Cabinet](/cabinet)

Keep files in #O#drawers#, like a file explorer. #O#New Drawer#, #O#New Folder# and #O#Upload Files# are on the Home tab, and #O#Cards# or #O#List# views are in View. A whole drive downloads at once as a ZIP, and the Share tab can save a drawer as a `.kc` or `.zip` file!
